{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53782","headline":"赞崔氏夫人（幷序○题拟） 二 · 白居易","name":"赞崔氏夫人（幷序○题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拜别高堂日欲斜，红巾拭泪贵新花。\n徒来生处却爲客，今日随夫始是家。\n（见《敦煌掇琐》二○录伯二六三三卷。\n原附《崔氏夫人要女文一本》後，题作「白侍郎赞」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}